---
import GuideLayout from '../../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
const toc=[{href:'#overview',label:'Overview'},{href:'#access',label:'How to Access'},{href:'#reports',label:'Exploration Reports'},{href:'#cards',label:'Card Research'},{href:'#pages',label:'Pages & Effects'},{href:'#special',label:'Special Stage'},{href:'#auto',label:'Auto research'},{href:'#summary',label:'Effects Summary'},{href:'#strategy',label:'Efficient Strategy'},{href:'#mistakes',label:'Common Mistakes'}];
---
<GuideLayout title="Aden Laboratory | L2 Guardian Guides" lang="en" active="aden-laboratory" toc={toc}>
<div class="content">
  <a class="back" href="/en/">← Back to home</a>
  <section class="hero"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-effects-summary.png" alt="Aden Laboratory and its active effects in L2 Reborn Guardian"/><div class="hero-body"><div class="badge">GUARDIAN SYSTEM</div><h1>Aden Laboratory</h1><p class="subtitle">A permanent progression system where Exploration Reports reveal boss cards, complete research pages and unlock randomized Special Stage bonuses.</p><div class="info-grid"><div class="info-card"><div class="label">Daily Reports</div><div class="value">8</div></div><div class="info-card"><div class="label">Card Cost</div><div class="value">1 Report + 25k</div></div><div class="info-card"><div class="label">Pages per Cycle</div><div class="value">4</div></div><div class="info-card"><div class="label">Special Research</div><div class="value">50k Adena</div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section quick-start"><div class="quick-head"><div class="quick-icon">⚡</div><div><h2>Quick Start</h2><p>The complete cycle in four steps.</p></div></div><div class="quick-grid"><div class="quick-card"><div class="quick-title">Farm Daily</div><div class="quick-value">8 Reports</div><span class="quick-tag high">Keep Them</span></div><div class="quick-card"><div class="quick-title">Reveal Cards</div><div class="quick-value">25k Adena</div><span class="quick-tag high">Per Card</span></div><div class="quick-card"><div class="quick-title">Each Page</div><div class="quick-value">Permanent Stats</div><span class="quick-tag high">Immediately</span></div><div class="quick-card"><div class="quick-title">Special Roll</div><div class="quick-value">50k Adena</div><span class="quick-tag medium">Avoid Chasing</span></div></div><div class="quick-footer"><div class="quick-tip"><strong>Misses improve the odds</strong>Every wrong card is burned and removed from the current pool.</div><div class="quick-tip"><strong>Complete 4 pages</strong>Each page grants its effects immediately; completing four unlocks the Special Stage.</div><div class="quick-tip"><strong>New server priority</strong>Accept a reasonable Special Stage result instead of spending heavily on rare levels.</div></div></section>

  <section class="section" id="overview"><h2>Overview</h2><p>Aden Laboratory progresses through research pages. Each page hides one correct boss card among several wrong cards. Selecting the correct card completes the page, permanently applies all effects assigned to it and automatically moves the character to the next page.</p><p>After four correct boss cards, which means four completed pages, so the Special Stage becomes available. This stage provides an additional randomized property whose strength depends on the level rolled.</p><div class="note"><strong>Permanent progress:</strong> unused Aden's Exploration Reports remain in the inventory and can be saved for future days.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="access"><h2>How to Access Aden Laboratory</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Open the main menu</strong><p>Click the menu button in the bottom right corner of the game interface.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>Select Aden Laboratory</strong><p>Click the Aden Laboratory icon in the general menu to open the current research page.</p></div></div></div><figure class="guide-figure wide"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-menu.png" alt="Aden Laboratory icon in the main menu"/><figcaption>Aden Laboratory is accessed from the bottom right general menu.</figcaption></figure></section>

  <section class="section" id="reports"><h2>Aden's Exploration Reports</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>Daily Amount</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monster farming</td><td class="good">8 Reports</td><td>One Report is consumed for every card selected.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each card selection costs <strong>1 Aden's Exploration Report and 25,000 Adena</strong>. Reports that are not used remain in the inventory, so missing a research session does not destroy the materials already farmed.</p><div class="note"><strong>Budgeting:</strong> eight card selections cost 200,000 Adena in total. The number of completed pages obtained from those eight Reports depends on how quickly the boss cards are found.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="cards"><h2>Card Research</h2><p>Every page contains exactly one correct boss card. The success rate displayed at the bottom represents the number of correct cards remaining over the total unopened cards.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Select a card</strong><p>The game consumes one Report and 25,000 Adena.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>If the card is wrong</strong><p>It is burned and removed from the pool. The correct card remains, so the next probability improves. For example, 1/32 becomes 1/31.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><strong>If the boss card is found</strong><p>Every effect shown at the top of the page is applied automatically. The page is completed and the next one opens immediately.</p></div></div></div><figure class="guide-figure wide"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-cards.png" alt="Aden Laboratory card research with one correct card among eight"/><figcaption>This page has one correct card among eight unopened cards, giving a 1/8 success rate.</figcaption></figure><div class="note"><strong>No duplicate failure:</strong> a burned card cannot be selected again on that page. Every miss moves the player closer to the guaranteed boss card.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="pages"><h2>Pages and Permanent Effects</h2><p>Completing a page requires finding its boss card. The effects displayed at the top are granted automatically, and a page may provide more than one statistic at the same time. Four completed pages unlock the Special Stage.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Examples visible in Guardian</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>P. Def. / M. Def.</td><td>Permanent defensive stats</td></tr><tr><td>Max HP / Max MP</td><td>Resource and survivability increases</td></tr><tr><td>Atk. Spd. / Casting Spd.</td><td>Attack or casting speed</td></tr><tr><td>Speed</td><td>Movement speed</td></tr><tr><td>HP Recovery Potions' Effect</td><td>Improves potion recovery</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="warning"><strong>Multiple effects per page:</strong> the summary window only displays the first statistic of each completed page. Secondary statistics are still active even though they are not listed there.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="special"><h2>Special Stage</h2><p>After completing four normal pages, the Special Stage rolls an additional property. Clicking <strong>Begin Research</strong> costs 50,000 Adena and generates a new level according to the probabilities shown on the right side of the interface.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Roll a new property level</strong><p>Begin Research generates a result but does not immediately replace the current setting.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>Compare both results</strong><p>The current setting remains at the top and the newly rolled setting appears below it.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><strong>Keep or replace</strong><p>If the new result is worse, simply roll again or leave. If it is better, click Property Replacement and pay 1,000,000 Adena to apply it.</p></div></div></div><figure class="guide-figure wide"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-special-stage.png" alt="Aden Laboratory Special Stage with property levels and success rates"/><figcaption>The right panel shows the exact growth value and probability for every available level of the current property.</figcaption></figure><div class="note"><strong>Example:</strong> the screenshot shows a current P./M. Atk. Lv. 5 bonus of +10 and a newly rolled Lv. 8 bonus of +19. Property Replacement is required to equip the stronger result.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="auto"><h2>Auto research</h2><p>Auto research repeatedly spends 50,000 Adena per roll until the result reaches or surpasses the selected target level. This is a convenience tool, not a discount.</p><figure class="guide-figure compact"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-auto-research.png" alt="Aden Laboratory Auto research target level configuration"/><figcaption>Set a target only after checking its probability and the Adena you are willing to spend.</figcaption></figure><div class="warning"><strong>Potentially very expensive:</strong> rare levels can have extremely low probabilities. A 0.01% target averages one success in 10,000 rolls, which would represent 500 million Adena at 50,000 per roll. Random results are never guaranteed at the average, so actual spending can be lower or much higher.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="summary"><h2>Checking All Active Effects</h2><p>Click the magnifying glass icon in the top right corner of Aden Laboratory to open the Effect on Receipt panel. It separates Special Stage properties from the general effects earned through normal pages.</p><figure class="guide-figure wide"><img src="/images/aden-laboratory-effects-summary.png" alt="Aden Laboratory Effect on Receipt summary"/><figcaption>The panel summarizes acquired stats, but only lists the first effect from each normal page.</figcaption></figure><div class="warning"><strong>Display limitation:</strong> if a page grants Atk. Spd. +80 and P. Atk. +30, the summary may show only Atk. Spd. +80. The hidden P. Atk. +30 is still applied to the character.</div></section>

  <section class="section" id="strategy"><h2>Efficient Strategy on a New Server</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Farm all eight Reports</strong><p>They are permanent materials and can be accumulated even when Adena is needed elsewhere.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>Progress normal pages consistently</strong><p>Normal research gives permanent effects and wrong cards permanently improve the odds on the current page.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><strong>Accept a reasonable Special result</strong><p>Early in the server, equipment and core progression usually provide better returns than repeatedly chasing a rare laboratory level.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">4</div><div><strong>Avoid aggressive Auto research targets</strong><p>Use the probability panel to estimate the risk and establish a strict Adena budget before starting.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section" id="mistakes"><h2>Common Mistakes</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Mistake</th><th>Impact</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Assuming failed cards waste progress</td><td>Every miss removes a wrong card and improves the next chance.</td></tr><tr><td>Thinking Begin Research equips the result</td><td>Property Replacement and 1 million Adena are required to apply it.</td></tr><tr><td>Setting a very rare Auto research target</td><td class="bad">The system can consume a very large amount of Adena automatically.</td></tr><tr><td>Trusting the summary as a complete stat list</td><td>Secondary page effects are active but may not be displayed.</td></tr><tr><td>Overspending during early progression</td><td class="bad">Other systems may offer substantially better value during the early stages of a server.</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
</div>
</GuideLayout>
